{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459720/extras/bf74b9c4227378020fb764f1a197c2a4.avif?t=1773622181\" width=616 height=263 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soul Tides is a dark-fantasy tug-of-war strategy game where players summon armies, build shrines, and push the battlefield toward their enemy\u2019s stronghold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inspired by the legendary Warcraft III custom map era</strong>, Soul Tides brings the classic tug-of-war strategy formula into a modern standalone game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2694\ufe0f Features \u2694\ufe0f</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2696\ufe0f <strong>Tug-of-War Combat</strong> \u2013 Deploy minions that <strong>fight automatically</strong>, pushing the frontlines toward your enemy\u2019s stronghold in a relentless battle for control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459720/extras/faea486453314c31bf2bf5a1fdf00d1b.poster.avif?t=1773622181\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459720/extras/faea486453314c31bf2bf5a1fdf00d1b.webm?t=1773622181\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459720/extras/faea486453314c31bf2bf5a1fdf00d1b.mp4?t=1773622181\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee0 <strong>Build &amp; Expand</strong> \u2013 Construct Shrines and fortifications to unlock powerful <strong>Blessings and units</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459720/extras/4cd05312f13fa74118fa23e017fa1598.poster.avif?t=1773622181\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459720/extras/4cd05312f13fa74118fa23e017fa1598.webm?t=1773622181\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459720/extras/4cd05312f13fa74118fa23e017fa1598.mp4?t=1773622181\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a1 <strong>Customize Your Army</strong> \u2013 Research and assign <strong>unique abilities</strong> to your minions, creating devastating synergies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459720/extras/0c774ab20c135271584bf8de109d95bc.poster.avif?t=1773622181\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459720/extras/0c774ab20c135271584bf8de109d95bc.webm?t=1773622181\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459720/extras/0c774ab20c135271584bf8de109d95bc.mp4?t=1773622181\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd2e <strong>Pray for Power</strong> \u2013 Unlock new <strong>units and abilities</strong> to dominate the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459720/extras/95d308c56596945c41ad035f7e1aa82a.poster.avif?t=1773622181\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459720/extras/95d308c56596945c41ad035f7e1aa82a.webm?t=1773622181\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459720/extras/95d308c56596945c41ad035f7e1aa82a.mp4?t=1773622181\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcdc <strong>Deep Tech Tree</strong> \u2013 Unlock new strategies with a <strong>dynamic research system</strong> that ensures no two matches play out the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfad <strong>Multiplayer Mayhem</strong> \u2013 Challenge friends and rivals in <strong>intense PvP battles</strong>, where strategy and adaptation are the keys to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459720/extras/ac7aac9ac929fb32f86f786b53f7cdfa.poster.avif?t=1773622181\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459720/extras/ac7aac9ac929fb32f86f786b53f7cdfa.webm?t=1773622181\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459720/extras/ac7aac9ac929fb32f86f786b53f7cdfa.mp4?t=1773622181\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f3 <strong>Resource Management</strong> \u2013 Balance <strong>Gold, Supply, and Souls\u00a0</strong>to maintain an army capable of overwhelming your foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0c <strong>Dark Fantasy Atmosphere</strong> \u2013 Immerse yourself in a world of <strong>forbidden magic, demonic bargains, and relentless warfare</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc51 <strong>Trials \u2014 Single Player Challenge Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond the battlefield lies a path of Trials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this single-player challenge mode, you will face a series of encounters designed to test your mastery of strategy and adaptation. Each Trial presents new enemies, modifiers, and powerful guardians that stand between you and victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your shrines, shape your army, and push the frontlines forward as you battle through a map of Trials. Defeat formidable bosses, experiment with different builds, and discover powerful combinations of units and Blessings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victory is only the beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is a chance to refine your strategy and prove your command of the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459720/extras/8453f35426360c23e5546e20eb593899.poster.avif?t=1773622181\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459720/extras/8453f35426360c23e5546e20eb593899.webm?t=1773622181\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459720/extras/8453f35426360c23e5546e20eb593899.mp4?t=1773622181\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Trials Feature Highlights</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694 <strong>Epic Boss Encounters</strong><br>Face powerful enemies that guard the path forward and demand new strategies to defeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddfa <strong>Trial Map Progression</strong><br>Advance through a network of encounters, each bringing new challenges and opportunities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 <strong>Endless Build Possibilities</strong><br>Combine shrines and Blessings to create unique armies every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Score-Based Leaderboards</strong><br>Compete for the fastest victories and highest scores.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Will you rise once more, or be cast into oblivion?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlist Soul Tides now to be notified when the battle begins.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/ima