 Features \u2694\ufe0f</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2696\ufe0f <strong>Tug-of-War Combat</strong> \u2013 Deploy minions that <strong>fight automatically</strong>, pushing the frontlines toward your enemy\u2019s stronghold in a relentless battle for control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459720/extras/faea486453314c31bf2bf5a1fdf00d1b.poster.avif?t=1773622181\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459720/extras/faea486453314c31bf2bf5a1fdf00d1b.webm?t=1773622181\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459720/extras/faea486453314c31bf2bf5a1fdf00d1b.mp4?t=1773622181\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee0 <strong>Build &amp; Expand</strong> \u2013 Construct Shrines and fortifications to unlock powerful <strong>Blessings and units</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459720/extras/4cd05312f13fa74118fa23e017fa1598.poster.avif?t=1773622181\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459720/extras/4cd05312f13fa74118fa23e017fa1598.webm?t=1773622181\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459720/extras/4cd05312f13fa74118fa23e017fa1598.mp4?t=1773622181\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a1 <strong>Customize Your Army</strong> \u2013 Research and assign <strong>unique abilities</strong> to your minions, creating devastating synergies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video