9720/extras/ac7aac9ac929fb32f86f786b53f7cdfa.poster.avif?t=1773622181\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459720/extras/ac7aac9ac929fb32f86f786b53f7cdfa.webm?t=1773622181\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459720/extras/ac7aac9ac929fb32f86f786b53f7cdfa.mp4?t=1773622181\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f3 <strong>Resource Management</strong> \u2013 Balance <strong>Gold, Supply, and Souls\u00a0</strong>to maintain an army capable of overwhelming your foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0c <strong>Dark Fantasy Atmosphere</strong> \u2013 Immerse yourself in a world of <strong>forbidden magic, demonic bargains, and relentless warfare</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc51 <strong>Trials \u2014 Single Player Challenge Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond the battlefield lies a path of Trials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this single-player challenge mode, you will face a series of encounters designed to test your mastery of strategy and adaptation. Each Trial presents new enemies, modifiers, and powerful guardians that stand between you and victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your shrines, shape your army, and push the frontlines forward as you battle through a map of Trials. Defeat formidable bosses, experiment with different builds, and discover powerful combinations of units and Blessings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victory is only the beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is a chance to refine your strategy and prove your command of the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459720/extras/8453f35426360c23e5546e20eb593899.poster.avif?t=1773622181\" width=1170